1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,200
A blue flame. A sweet smell. A little
headache. Your lungs go tight. You
start to cough.

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:07,833
Sam. Turn it off. Turn it off now.

3
00:00:08,333 --> 00:00:11,867
It's just a little stove. It's fine.
I'm fine. Why is the room spinning?

4
00:00:12,367 --> 00:00:20,300
A gas stove burns up the air in a
closed room, and gives you a gas you
cannot smell. You can't see it. You
can't feel it. You just get sleepy.

5
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:26,567
You drag him out into the hall. He
sits on the floor, gray and dizzy. You
can finally breathe, a little.

6
00:00:27,067 --> 00:00:33,433
Rule seven. Never burn anything
indoors. No stove. No candle. No
generator. Not in a closed room.
